# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Ignored by GitHub Pages.
#
# One canonical hostname. Every canonical tag, the sitemap and the JSON-LD all
# say https://khaana.com, so www should not be a second address serving the
# same pages: search engines treat them as separate sites and split the
# ranking between them.
https://www.khaana.com/* https://khaana.com/:splat 301
